{"id":"4c14656043bc77c1","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-arithmetized-proof.md","title":"df arithmetized proof","display":"df arithmetized proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","aliases":["72-df-arithmetized-proof"],"display":"df arithmetized proof","depends_on":["[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §§2.1.1–2.1.3, print113–118/PDF125–130; explicit local proof-certificate checker, PR instead of source bounded-arithmetic encoding","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-and-local-standard-model-equivalence","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"校正原误指向有界算术的来源页并登记检查器值域"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-arithmetized-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-arithmetized-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df arithmetized proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §§2.1.1–2.1.3, print113–118/PDF125–130; explicit local proof-certificate checker, PR instead of source bounded-arithmetic encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-and-local-standard-model-equivalence"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"校正原误指向有界算术的来源页并登记检查器值域"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论为ZFC。取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a> 的公式、逻辑公理及有限推导。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\in\\{1,2\\}\">\\(\\iota\\in\\{1,2\\}\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=1\">\\(\\iota=1\\)</span> 为无集变量的数语法，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=2\">\\(\\iota=2\\)</span> 为完整两类变量语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F:=\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}\">\\(\\mathcal F:=\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V:=\\mathcal V_\\iota\">\\(\\mathcal V:=\\mathcal V_\\iota\\)</span>，其定义和受限可证性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\">\\(\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\\)</span> 在下式给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 包含 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\rm PR}\">\\(E_{\\rm PR}\\)</span>，保留每个符号的种类和元数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}\\)</span> 有效可公理化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_N:=(0=S0)\">\\(\\bot_N:=(0=S0)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,x_1\\in V_N\">\\(x_0,x_1\\in V_N\\)</span> 为固定互异变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n:=S^n0\">\\(\\overline n:=S^n0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>程序、元数、解释取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dagger\">\\(\\dagger\\)</span> 是不属于有限记录集合的非法解码值。下式先定义编码数据集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}\">\\(\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}\\)</span>，再定义带公理证书、逻辑证书和检查程序的集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\">\\(\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\langle\\gamma,AC,LC,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\">\\(\\kappa=\\langle\\gamma,AC,LC,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma=\\langle e,v,\\operatorname{cs},\\operatorname{ds}\\rangle\">\\(\\gamma=\\langle e,v,\\operatorname{cs},\\operatorname{ds}\\rangle\\)</span>。投影下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 表示同一元组的相应分量，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_\\kappa=e\">\\(e_\\kappa=e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_\\kappa=c\">\\(c_\\kappa=c\\)</span>。所有编码器和检查程序都是数据，不由Remark选择。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,a,b,i,j,k,m,n,s,z\">\\(p,a,b,i,j,k,m,n,s,z\\)</span> 在编码关系中遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,W\">\\(U,W\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inj}\">\\(\\operatorname{Inj}\\)</span> 的任意集合参数；数值全称构造中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>。数值观察函数先在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}\\)</span> 上定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PR}_1\">\\(\\mathsf{PR}_1\\)</span> 的输入为自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^1\">\\(\\omega^1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 用单坐标识别。有限序列从0编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_j\">\\(r_j\\)</span> 是理由元组的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 坐标。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(s,t)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(t)\\)</span> 的实参则为数项。后一构造的绑定变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(t):=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\}}\">\\(u(t):=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\}}\\)</span>；不捕获实参中的自由变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa}(T)\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa}(T)\\)</span> 只表示本文件末式给出的标准数解释，不在这里引入任意公式的真谓词。无下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prf}_T,\\operatorname{Prov}_T,\\operatorname{Con}(T),\\operatorname{Good}_T,\\operatorname{Check}_T,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\">\\(\\operatorname{Prf}_T,\\operatorname{Prov}_T,\\operatorname{Con}(T),\\operatorname{Good}_T,\\operatorname{Check}_T,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\)</span> 仅在固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 后使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal F_{1,E}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E),\\quad\\mathcal F_{2,E}:=\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_1&amp;:=V_N,\\quad\\mathcal V_2:=V_N\\cup V_S,\\\\\n\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}:\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\iota,E}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Log}_2(E)\\cap\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_2^{(\\iota)}(T,q)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow q\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{Deriv}_2(T,q),\\\\\nT\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists q\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{Deriv}_2^{(\\iota)}(T,q)\\land0&lt;|q|\\land q_{|q|-1}=A].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal F_{1,E}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E),\\quad\\mathcal F_{2,E}:=\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_1&amp;:=V_N,\\quad\\mathcal V_2:=V_N\\cup V_S,\\\\\n\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}:\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\iota,E}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Log}_2(E)\\cap\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_2^{(\\iota)}(T,q)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow q\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{Deriv}_2(T,q),\\\\\nT\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists q\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{Deriv}_2^{(\\iota)}(T,q)\\land0&lt;|q|\\land q_{|q|-1}=A].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PR}_k&amp;:=\\{⟦ c⟧:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\land\\operatorname{ar}(c)=k\\},\\\\\n\\chi_R(\\vec n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec n\\in R,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec n\\notin R,\\end{cases}\\qquad(R\\subseteq\\omega^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PRRel}_k&amp;:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_R\\in\\mathsf{PR}_k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(U,W)&amp;:=\\{f\\in W^U:\\forall a,b\\in U\\ (f(a)=f(b)\\to a=b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ax}&amp;:=0,\\quad\\mathsf{log}:=1,\\quad\\mathsf{mp}:=2,\\quad\\mathsf{gen}:=3,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Reason}&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{ax},s\\rangle:s\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{log},c\\rangle:c\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{mp},j,k\\rangle:j,k\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{gen},j,z\\rangle:j,z\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rec}&amp;:=(\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reason})^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathcal F,\\omega)\\times\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathcal V,\\omega)\\times\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{Rec},\\omega)\\times(\\mathsf{Rec}\\cup\\{\\dagger\\})^\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PR}_k&amp;:=\\{⟦ c⟧:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\land\\operatorname{ar}(c)=k\\},\\\\\n\\chi_R(\\vec n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec n\\in R,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec n\\notin R,\\end{cases}\\qquad(R\\subseteq\\omega^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PRRel}_k&amp;:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_R\\in\\mathsf{PR}_k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(U,W)&amp;:=\\{f\\in W^U:\\forall a,b\\in U\\ (f(a)=f(b)\\to a=b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ax}&amp;:=0,\\quad\\mathsf{log}:=1,\\quad\\mathsf{mp}:=2,\\quad\\mathsf{gen}:=3,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Reason}&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{ax},s\\rangle:s\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{log},c\\rangle:c\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{mp},j,k\\rangle:j,k\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{gen},j,z\\rangle:j,z\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rec}&amp;:=(\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reason})^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathcal F,\\omega)\\times\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathcal V,\\omega)\\times\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{Rec},\\omega)\\times(\\mathsf{Rec}\\cup\\{\\dagger\\})^\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ne_\\gamma&amp;:=\\gamma_0,\\quad v_\\gamma:=\\gamma_1,\\quad \\operatorname{cs}_\\gamma:=\\gamma_2,\\quad\\operatorname{ds}_\\gamma:=\\gamma_3,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqOK}_{\\gamma}(p)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\operatorname{ds}(p)\\ne\\dagger,\\\\0,&amp;\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger,\\end{cases}\\\\\nL_{\\gamma}(p)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}|\\operatorname{ds}(p)|,&amp;\\operatorname{ds}(p)\\ne\\dagger,\\\\0,&amp;\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger,\\end{cases}\\\\\nF_{\\gamma}(p,i)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}a,&amp;i&lt;L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle,\\\\0,&amp;i\\ge L_{\\gamma}(p),\\end{cases}\\\\\nH_{\\gamma,j}(p,i)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}r_j,&amp;i&lt;L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle\\land j&lt;|r|,\\\\0,&amp;\\neg\\exists a,r\\ (i&lt;L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle\\land j&lt;|r|),\\end{cases}\\quad(j&lt;3),\\\\\nI_e(a,b)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}e(A\\to B),&amp;a=e(A)\\land b=e(B),\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\lor b\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\nQ_{e,v}(z,a)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}e(\\forall u A),&amp;z=v(u)\\land a=e(A),\\\\0,&amp;z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(v)\\lor a\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubCode}_e(a,n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}e(A[\\overline n/x_0]),&amp;a=e(A)\\land\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\},\\\\e(\\bot_N),&amp;\\neg\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\ (a=e(A)\\land\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\}).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ne_\\gamma&amp;:=\\gamma_0,\\quad v_\\gamma:=\\gamma_1,\\quad \\operatorname{cs}_\\gamma:=\\gamma_2,\\quad\\operatorname{ds}_\\gamma:=\\gamma_3,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqOK}_{\\gamma}(p)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\operatorname{ds}(p)\\ne\\dagger,\\\\0,&amp;\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger,\\end{cases}\\\\\nL_{\\gamma}(p)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}|\\operatorname{ds}(p)|,&amp;\\operatorname{ds}(p)\\ne\\dagger,\\\\0,&amp;\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger,\\end{cases}\\\\\nF_{\\gamma}(p,i)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}a,&amp;i&lt;L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle,\\\\0,&amp;i\\ge L_{\\gamma}(p),\\end{cases}\\\\\nH_{\\gamma,j}(p,i)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}r_j,&amp;i&lt;L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle\\land j&lt;|r|,\\\\0,&amp;\\neg\\exists a,r\\ (i&lt;L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle\\land j&lt;|r|),\\end{cases}\\quad(j&lt;3),\\\\\nI_e(a,b)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}e(A\\to B),&amp;a=e(A)\\land b=e(B),\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\lor b\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\nQ_{e,v}(z,a)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}e(\\forall u A),&amp;z=v(u)\\land a=e(A),\\\\0,&amp;z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(v)\\lor a\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubCode}_e(a,n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}e(A[\\overline n/x_0]),&amp;a=e(A)\\land\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\},\\\\e(\\bot_N),&amp;\\neg\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\ (a=e(A)\\land\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\}).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}:=\\{\\gamma=\\langle e,v,\\operatorname{cs},\\operatorname{ds}\\rangle\\in\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}:\\ &amp;\\forall q\\in\\mathsf{Rec}\\ (\\operatorname{ds}(\\operatorname{cs}(q))=q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{cs})\\ (\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(e)},\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(v)},\\operatorname{SeqOK}_\\gamma,L_\\gamma\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{PR}_1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{F_\\gamma,H_{\\gamma,0},H_{\\gamma,1},H_{\\gamma,2},I_e,Q_{e,v},\\operatorname{SubCode}_e\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{PR}_2\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}:=\\{\\gamma=\\langle e,v,\\operatorname{cs},\\operatorname{ds}\\rangle\\in\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}:\\ &amp;\\forall q\\in\\mathsf{Rec}\\ (\\operatorname{ds}(\\operatorname{cs}(q))=q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{cs})\\ (\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(e)},\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(v)},\\operatorname{SeqOK}_\\gamma,L_\\gamma\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{PR}_1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{F_\\gamma,H_{\\gamma,0},H_{\\gamma,1},H_{\\gamma,2},I_e,Q_{e,v},\\operatorname{SubCode}_e\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{PR}_2\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists\\vec A\\in\\mathcal F^m\\ \\exists\\vec r\\in\\mathsf{Reason}^m\\ [\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\langle\\langle e(A_i),r_i\\rangle\\rangle_{i&lt;m}\\land e(A_{m-1})=a\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ (\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{ax},s\\rangle\\land AC(e(A_i),s))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{log},c\\rangle\\land LC(c,e(A_i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{mp},j,k\\rangle\\land A_k=(A_j\\to A_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathcal V\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{gen},j,v(z)\\rangle\\land A_i=\\forall z A_j))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a),\\\\0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists\\vec A\\in\\mathcal F^m\\ \\exists\\vec r\\in\\mathsf{Reason}^m\\ [\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\langle\\langle e(A_i),r_i\\rangle\\rangle_{i&lt;m}\\land e(A_{m-1})=a\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ (\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{ax},s\\rangle\\land AC(e(A_i),s))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{log},c\\rangle\\land LC(c,e(A_i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{mp},j,k\\rangle\\land A_k=(A_j\\to A_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathcal V\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{gen},j,v(z)\\rangle\\land A_i=\\forall z A_j))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a),\\\\0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T):=\\{\\langle\\gamma,AC,LC,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}\\times\\mathsf{PRRel}_2\\times\\mathsf{PRRel}_2\\times\\operatorname{PRProg}:\\ &amp;\\operatorname{ar}(c)=2\\land⟦ c⟧=\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ ((\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ AC(a,s))\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in T\\ e_\\gamma(A)=a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ ((\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ LC(s,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal L_{\\iota,E}\\ e_\\gamma(A)=a)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T):=\\{\\langle\\gamma,AC,LC,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}\\times\\mathsf{PRRel}_2\\times\\mathsf{PRRel}_2\\times\\operatorname{PRProg}:\\ &amp;\\operatorname{ar}(c)=2\\land⟦ c⟧=\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ ((\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ AC(a,s))\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in T\\ e_\\gamma(A)=a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ ((\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ LC(s,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal L_{\\iota,E}\\ e_\\gamma(A)=a)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\gamma_\\kappa&amp;:=\\kappa_0,\\quad AC_\\kappa:=\\kappa_1,\\quad LC_\\kappa:=\\kappa_2,\\quad c_\\kappa:=\\kappa_3,\\quad e_\\kappa:=e_{\\gamma_\\kappa},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(s,t)&amp;:=(f_{c_\\kappa}(s,t)=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(t)&amp;:=\\exists u(t)\\ (f_{c_\\kappa}(u(t),t)=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)&amp;:=\\forall x_0\\neg\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(x_0,\\overline{e_\\kappa(\\bot_N)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(\\iota)}(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\\bot_N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(\\iota)}(T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma_\\kappa,AC_\\kappa,LC_\\kappa},\\qquad\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}:=\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma_\\kappa,AC_\\kappa,LC_\\kappa},\\\\\n\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}(n,e_\\kappa(\\bot_N))=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prf}_T&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Prov}_T:=\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Con}(T):=\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Good}_T&amp;:=\\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Check}_T:=\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\ulcorner A\\urcorner:=e_\\kappa(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\gamma_\\kappa&amp;:=\\kappa_0,\\quad AC_\\kappa:=\\kappa_1,\\quad LC_\\kappa:=\\kappa_2,\\quad c_\\kappa:=\\kappa_3,\\quad e_\\kappa:=e_{\\gamma_\\kappa},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(s,t)&amp;:=(f_{c_\\kappa}(s,t)=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(t)&amp;:=\\exists u(t)\\ (f_{c_\\kappa}(u(t),t)=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)&amp;:=\\forall x_0\\neg\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(x_0,\\overline{e_\\kappa(\\bot_N)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(\\iota)}(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\\bot_N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(\\iota)}(T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma_\\kappa,AC_\\kappa,LC_\\kappa},\\qquad\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}:=\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma_\\kappa,AC_\\kappa,LC_\\kappa},\\\\\n\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}(n,e_\\kappa(\\bot_N))=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prf}_T&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Prov}_T:=\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Con}(T):=\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Good}_T&amp;:=\\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Check}_T:=\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\ulcorner A\\urcorner:=e_\\kappa(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\quad(\\exists p\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa}(p,e_\\kappa(A))\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)} A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\quad(\\exists p\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa}(p,e_\\kappa(A))\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)} A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\quad(\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\quad(\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p,a\\in\\omega\\quad\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}(p,a)\\in\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p,a\\in\\omega\\quad\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}(p,a)\\in\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限记录检查的原有数学内容保留：逐行核对证书、较早的MP前提和概括前提。数值观察函数及坏码输出现在逐一给出，因此“原始递归编码”不再承担未列明的解码约定。编码元组、检查程序和对象公式的语言一并固定；定义域要求包含PR符号，不再把不存在的函数符号加入公式。公理证书只要求可枚举性，不误要求公理集可判定。数语法与两类变量语法分别使用带模式下标的数据族，数语法的检查器不接受含集变量的逻辑行；不能在数变量PRA和完整两类变量推导之间静默切换。</p>\n<p>擦去通过检查的记录中的理由得到有限推导；反向逐行选择证书和前提索引。标准模型中的两个等价式仍然只是外部结论。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\">\\(\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\)</span> 不要求不同编码在PRA内可证等价，也不自动保证Löb可证性条件或Gentzen下降证书。使用这些理论内性质的下游文件必须另外声明相应条件。可证性公式采用固定的新鲜变量函数，避免把实参数项中的自由变量意外绑定。</p>\n<p>本轮回查原 PDF：证明序列、推理证据与 Prf 的算术化位于 II§2.1，印刷113–118/PDF125–130；旧来源字段的95–99页属于其他算术讨论，不能定位本接口。新增值域式直接由 Check 的两互斥分支得到；不将它当作 T 内部已经证明的检查器性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"元理论为ZFC。取 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的公式、逻辑公理及有限推导。固定 $\\iota\\in\\{1,2\\}$：$\\iota=1$ 为无集变量的数语法，$\\iota=2$ 为完整两类变量语法。$\\mathcal F:=\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}$、$\\mathcal V:=\\mathcal V_\\iota$，其定义和受限可证性 $\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}$ 在下式给出。$E$ 包含 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]] 的 $E_{\\rm PR}$，保留每个符号的种类和元数；$T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}$ 有效可公理化。$\\bot_N:=(0=S0)$，$x_0,x_1\\in V_N$ 为固定互异变量，$\\overline n:=S^n0$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"元理论为ZFC。取 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的公式、逻辑公理及有限推导。固定 $\\iota\\in\\{1,2\\}$：$\\iota=1$ 为无集变量的数语法，$\\iota=2$ 为完整两类变量语法。$\\mathcal F:=\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}$、$\\mathcal V:=\\mathcal V_\\iota$，其定义和受限可证性 $\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}$ 在下式给出。$E$ 包含 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]] 的 $E_{\\rm PR}$，保留每个符号的种类和元数；$T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}$ 有效可公理化。$\\bot_N:=(0=S0)$，$x_0,x_1\\in V_N$ 为固定互异变量，$\\overline n:=S^n0$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"程序、元数、解释取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]。$\\dagger$ 是不属于有限记录集合的非法解码值。下式先定义编码数据集 $\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}$，再定义带公理证书、逻辑证书和检查程序的集合 $\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)$；$\\kappa=\\langle\\gamma,AC,LC,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)$，$\\gamma=\\langle e,v,\\operatorname{cs},\\operatorname{ds}\\rangle$。投影下标 $\\kappa$ 表示同一元组的相应分量，例如 $e_\\kappa=e$、$c_\\kappa=c$。所有编码器和检查程序都是数据，不由Remark选择。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\iota\\in\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota=2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F:=\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V:=\\mathcal V_\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"E_{\\rm PR}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_N:=(0=S0)","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,x_1\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n:=S^n0","display":false},{"tex":"\\dagger","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=\\langle\\gamma,AC,LC,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma=\\langle e,v,\\operatorname{cs},\\operatorname{ds}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"e_\\kappa=e","display":false},{"tex":"c_\\kappa=c","display":false},{"tex":"p,a,b,i,j,k,m,n,s,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"U,W","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inj}","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PR}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r_j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"u(t):=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prf}_T,\\operatorname{Prov}_T,\\operatorname{Con}(T),\\operatorname{Good}_T,\\operatorname{Check}_T,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal F_{1,E}&:=\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E),\\quad\\mathcal F_{2,E}:=\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_1&:=V_N,\\quad\\mathcal V_2:=V_N\\cup V_S,\\\\\n\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}&:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}:\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\iota,E}&:=\\operatorname{Log}_2(E)\\cap\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_2^{(\\iota)}(T,q)&:\\Longleftrightarrow q\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}^{<\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{Deriv}_2(T,q),\\\\\nT\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists q\\in\\mathcal F_{\\iota,E}^{<\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{Deriv}_2^{(\\iota)}(T,q)\\land0<|q|\\land q_{|q|-1}=A].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PR}_k&:=\\{⟦ c⟧:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\land\\operatorname{ar}(c)=k\\},\\\\\n\\chi_R(\\vec n)&:=\\begin{cases}1,&\\vec n\\in R,\\\\0,&\\vec n\\notin R,\\end{cases}\\qquad(R\\subseteq\\omega^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PRRel}_k&:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_R\\in\\mathsf{PR}_k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(U,W)&:=\\{f\\in W^U:\\forall a,b\\in U\\ (f(a)=f(b)\\to a=b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ax}&:=0,\\quad\\mathsf{log}:=1,\\quad\\mathsf{mp}:=2,\\quad\\mathsf{gen}:=3,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Reason}&:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{ax},s\\rangle:s\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{log},c\\rangle:c\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{mp},j,k\\rangle:j,k\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf{gen},j,z\\rangle:j,z\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rec}&:=(\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reason})^{<\\omega},\\\\\n\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}&:=\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathcal F,\\omega)\\times\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathcal V,\\omega)\\times\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{Rec},\\omega)\\times(\\mathsf{Rec}\\cup\\{\\dagger\\})^\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ne_\\gamma&:=\\gamma_0,\\quad v_\\gamma:=\\gamma_1,\\quad \\operatorname{cs}_\\gamma:=\\gamma_2,\\quad\\operatorname{ds}_\\gamma:=\\gamma_3,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqOK}_{\\gamma}(p)&:=\\begin{cases}1,&\\operatorname{ds}(p)\\ne\\dagger,\\\\0,&\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger,\\end{cases}\\\\\nL_{\\gamma}(p)&:=\\begin{cases}|\\operatorname{ds}(p)|,&\\operatorname{ds}(p)\\ne\\dagger,\\\\0,&\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger,\\end{cases}\\\\\nF_{\\gamma}(p,i)&:=\\begin{cases}a,&i<L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle,\\\\0,&i\\ge L_{\\gamma}(p),\\end{cases}\\\\\nH_{\\gamma,j}(p,i)&:=\\begin{cases}r_j,&i<L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle\\land j<|r|,\\\\0,&\\neg\\exists a,r\\ (i<L_{\\gamma}(p)\\land\\operatorname{ds}(p)_i=\\langle a,r\\rangle\\land j<|r|),\\end{cases}\\quad(j<3),\\\\\nI_e(a,b)&:=\\begin{cases}e(A\\to B),&a=e(A)\\land b=e(B),\\\\0,&a\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\lor b\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\nQ_{e,v}(z,a)&:=\\begin{cases}e(\\forall u A),&z=v(u)\\land a=e(A),\\\\0,&z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(v)\\lor a\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubCode}_e(a,n)&:=\\begin{cases}e(A[\\overline n/x_0]),&a=e(A)\\land\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\},\\\\e(\\bot_N),&\\neg\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\ (a=e(A)\\land\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\}).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}:=\\{\\gamma=\\langle e,v,\\operatorname{cs},\\operatorname{ds}\\rangle\\in\\mathcal G_{\\iota,E}:\\ &\\forall q\\in\\mathsf{Rec}\\ (\\operatorname{ds}(\\operatorname{cs}(q))=q)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{cs})\\ (\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\dagger)\\\\\n&\\land\\{\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(e)},\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(v)},\\operatorname{SeqOK}_\\gamma,L_\\gamma\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{PR}_1\\\\\n&\\land\\{F_\\gamma,H_{\\gamma,0},H_{\\gamma,1},H_{\\gamma,2},I_e,Q_{e,v},\\operatorname{SubCode}_e\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{PR}_2\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists\\vec A\\in\\mathcal F^m\\ \\exists\\vec r\\in\\mathsf{Reason}^m\\ [\\operatorname{ds}(p)=\\langle\\langle e(A_i),r_i\\rangle\\rangle_{i<m}\\land e(A_{m-1})=a\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i<m\\ (\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{ax},s\\rangle\\land AC(e(A_i),s))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{log},c\\rangle\\land LC(c,e(A_i)))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k<i\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{mp},j,k\\rangle\\land A_k=(A_j\\to A_i))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists j<i\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathcal V\\ (r_i=\\langle\\mathsf{gen},j,v(z)\\rangle\\land A_i=\\forall z A_j))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a)&:=\\begin{cases}1,&\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a),\\\\0,&\\neg\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}(p,a).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T):=\\{\\langle\\gamma,AC,LC,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}\\times\\mathsf{PRRel}_2\\times\\mathsf{PRRel}_2\\times\\operatorname{PRProg}:\\ &\\operatorname{ar}(c)=2\\land⟦ c⟧=\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma,AC,LC}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ ((\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ AC(a,s))\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in T\\ e_\\gamma(A)=a)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ ((\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ LC(s,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal L_{\\iota,E}\\ e_\\gamma(A)=a)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\gamma_\\kappa&:=\\kappa_0,\\quad AC_\\kappa:=\\kappa_1,\\quad LC_\\kappa:=\\kappa_2,\\quad c_\\kappa:=\\kappa_3,\\quad e_\\kappa:=e_{\\gamma_\\kappa},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(s,t)&:=(f_{c_\\kappa}(s,t)=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(t)&:=\\exists u(t)\\ (f_{c_\\kappa}(u(t),t)=1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)&:=\\forall x_0\\neg\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa}(x_0,\\overline{e_\\kappa(\\bot_N)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(\\iota)}(T)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\\bot_N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}(T)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(\\iota)}(T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa}&:=\\operatorname{Good}_{\\gamma_\\kappa,AC_\\kappa,LC_\\kappa},\\qquad\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}:=\\operatorname{Check}_{\\gamma_\\kappa,AC_\\kappa,LC_\\kappa},\\\\\n\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}(n,e_\\kappa(\\bot_N))=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prf}_T&:=\\operatorname{Prf}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Prov}_T:=\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Con}(T):=\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Good}_T&:=\\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\operatorname{Check}_T:=\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa},\\quad\\ulcorner A\\urcorner:=e_\\kappa(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\quad(\\exists p\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Good}_{T,\\kappa}(p,e_\\kappa(A))\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)} A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)\\quad(\\mathbb N\\models\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}(T)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall p,a\\in\\omega\\quad\\operatorname{Check}_{T,\\kappa}(p,a)\\in\\{0,1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":10810,"backlinks":[{"id":"85d54d65547349fa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\iota\\in\\{1,2\\}$，$E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}$ 保持符号种类和元数。$B,T_1,T_2\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}$ 是有效可公理化理论；模式句集、$\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}$ 与 $\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]，其基础有限演算取 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。"},{"id":"b61898f862c734c8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]] 的 $\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$、$\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}$、$e_\\kappa$、数码与捕获避免代入。$T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}$ 有效可公理化且包含 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]] 的 $\\mathsf{PRA}$；$\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$。"},{"id":"245122d1b4e24cdf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]] 的数语法模式 $\\iota=1$、理论 $T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E}$ 和 $\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E}(T)$、Prf 与 $\\bot_N$。$x_0,x_1,x_2$ 是互异数变量，$t$ 为该语言数项。"},{"id":"6d0ec6804191d5a4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B,S,T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}$ 有效可公理化，$\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq B$，$\\mathsf{PRA}$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]。$\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$、$\\lambda\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(S)$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-arithmetized-proof|df arithmetized proof]]"},{"id":"76fae203d87d09fc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A$ 遍历PR算术语言中无集量词的公式，可含自由集参数；$X$ 是集变量。下式对a和A的量化均为元语言量化；$\\mathsf{NT}$、$E_{\\rm PR}$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]，$\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(2)}(\\mathsf{NT})$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]，它是元命题，不是对象语言的Con句。"},{"id":"21edd49e38c96ce7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PRA},\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]，$\\mathsf{PA}$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]；$e_\\varepsilon$ 是上述模式使用的固定程序表示，不按外延相等更换程序。$\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PA})$、$\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(\\mathsf{PA})$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]。"},{"id":"6df5d33910671b21","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PA})$、$\\lambda\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PRA})$、$\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda,\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]；$q\\in\\mathsf P_1$、$\\operatorname{Trans}$ 取 [[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]。$\\operatorname{HBL}$ 取 [[72-df-derivability-conditions]]。"},{"id":"b3c39d743a421f30","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}$ 是有效公理化理论，$\\mathsf{PA}^{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T$，其中 $\\mathsf{PA}^{\\rm PR}$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]。取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]] 的数语法模式 $\\iota=1$、同一元组 $\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$ 及 $\\operatorname{Prf}_T,\\operatorname{Prov}_T$；$\\ulcorner A\\urcorner:=e_\\kappa(A)$，$\\vdash_2^{(1)}$ 是逐行限制到数语法的可证性关系。"}],"outgoing":["5e5fb64772853785","b63a805280ad1d8e","1a814f5220a079de"]}